OL,3,AQueues build outside British Museum as
OL,4,ABayeux Tapestry exhibit to open to
OL,5,Apublic for first time
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry is going on public
OL,8,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,9,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,10,Fago
OL,12,FDoors at the British Museum open at
OL,13,F10:00 BST and tickets are sold out for
OL,14,Fthe rest of the year - outside,
OL,15,Fshield-wielding re-enactors are already
OL,16,Fwaiting
OL,18,FThe 70m (230ft) tapestry is being
OL,19,Floaned to the museum while its usual
OL,20,Fhome in France undergoes renovation
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
